  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child project of the Global clean hydrogen programme for Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present Child Project of Malaysia  is part of the Global Clean Hydrogen Programme (GEF-8). This project aims to enhancing national institutional capacities, enabling policy frameworks, improving technological readiness at industrial level, and financial mechanisms for the successful uptake of clean hydrogen in Malaysia, to ensure its net zero development with social considerations and benefits.</narrative>
  </description>
